[[15,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Using a screwdriver, release the upper fastening clip (1a) and the lower fastening clip (1b) for the tailgate telescopic strut (1c) without detaching them.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179004877.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,3,0,"<p>1. Remove the tailgate telescopic strut.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179004878.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Position the tailgate telescopic strut and secure it using the special fastening clips.</p>"]]